<title>SINGAPORE: Pacific Can appoints deputy CEO.</title>
<headline>Pacific Can appoints deputy CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment company Pacific Can Investment Holdings Ltd said on Friday Chong Ah Kian had been appointed executive director and deputy chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The appointment comes into effect from February 1, 1997, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
